/*
 * Diagnostic-only shield: intentionally contributes no devicetree changes.
 * Combine with the "copen2_L" shield in build.yaml so the REAL copen2_L
 * physical wiring (row/col GPIOs, matrix transform, keymap) is used
 * unmodified. This shield only adds Kconfig via
 * copen2_l_standalone.conf, forcing the split "central" role + USB HID
 * so the left half can be tested as a standalone USB keyboard --
 * bypassing BLE/peripheral pairing entirely. See TODO.md for usage.
 */
